Veil 安装包再分发下列第三方组件。它们的二进制不进入 Git，构建时按 `installer/payload.manifest.json` 从上游发布包下载并校验。

## Virtual Display Driver 25.7.23

Copyright (c) 2024 Virtual Display

上游：<https://github.com/VirtualDrivers/Virtual-Display-Driver>
发布包：<https://github.com/VirtualDrivers/Virtual-Display-Driver/releases/download/25.7.23/VirtualDisplayDriver-x86.Driver.Only.zip>

随安装包写入 `%ProgramFiles%\Veil\vdd` 的文件：`MttVDD.inf`、`MttVDD.dll`、`mttvdd.cat`。

## NefCon 1.20.0

Copyright (c) 2022-2025 Nefarius Software Solutions e.U.

上游：<https://github.com/nefarius/nefcon>
发布包：<https://github.com/nefarius/nefcon/releases/download/v1.20.0/nefcon_v1.20.0.zip>

